# The root .gitignore drops every `models/` folder to keep AI weights out of git. This one is
# Rust source (server/docs/TECH_SPEC.md: models/user.rs, models/classroom.rs, ...), so keep it.
!/src/models/
# Same for `storage/`, which the root drops to keep uploaded files out of git: this one is the
# Rust module that writes them (TECH_SPEC section 3).
!/src/storage/
